<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>PCQ오류발생</title>
  <style>
    body {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f3f4f6;
    }
    .container {
      width: -webkit-fill-available;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 1000px;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0px 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    .container h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #333;
    }
    .container p {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #666;
    }
    .container a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background-color: #0a69cc;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .container a:hover {
      background-color: #084c99;
    }
    .icon {
      font-size: 100px;
      color: #0a69cc;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="icon">🚫</div>
  <h1>ERROR</h1>
  <p>요청하신 페이지를 처리하는 도중 오류가 발생했습니다.</p>
  <p>잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요. </p>
  <p>오류 시각 : 2026-09-03 00:24:24</p>
  <a href="/">홈페이지로 돌아가기</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
